Association StudentEducationOrganizationResponsibilityAssociation
    documentation "This association indicates a relationship between a student and an education organization other than an enrollment relationship, and generally indicating some kind of responsibility of the education organization for the student. Enrollment relationship semantics are covered by StudentSchoolAssociation."
    domain entity Student
        documentation "A reference to the student."
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization."
    descriptor Responsibility
        documentation "Indication of the responsible education organization's responsibility for a student, such as accountability, attendance, funding, etc."
        is part of identity
    date BeginDate
        documentation "Month, day, and year of the start date of an education organization's responsibility for a student.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation "Month, day, and year of the end date of an education organization's responsibility for a student.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "The organization for which the responsibility relationship to the student exists."
        is optional
        role name Responsible
